      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm. Seems like any humanoid bone w/ a physbone targeting it as the pb root no longer seems to rotate with IK even if the physbone is set to ignore the root via multi child type. \n\nUploaded a stripped down version of one of my avis where there's a PB on the chest for the breast physics. As well as pbs on the feet for the toes. There are toggle for the PBs in a Testing menu on the avatar. In full body you can see the shift in position of the upper body when the chest pb is toggled off, especially when lying down. Toes are a similar story to OP.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_4dafe69d-9244-4a54-894e-48ae3876fc9a",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
